cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use flexpyirt in published work, please cite it as below, giving the version you used."
type: software
title: "flexpyirt: Item Response Theory Estimation in Python with JAX"
abstract: >-
  Item response theory (IRT) estimation in Python, built on JAX: marginal maximum likelihood
  estimation with the Bock–Aitkin EM algorithm, including multiple-group calibration and fixed
  item parameter calibration, checked numerically against R mirt.
authors:
  - alias: takuizum
repository-code: "https://github.com/takuizum/flexpyirt"
url: "https://takuizum.github.io/flexpyirt/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - item response theory
  - IRT
  - psychometrics
  - EM algorithm
  - marginal maximum likelihood
  - JAX
